    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Notification channel that POSTs a JSON alert payload to an HTTP webhook.</para>
<para>The JSON body format: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;alert_name&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">:<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;...&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;alert_id&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">:<sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;...&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;severity&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">:<sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;WARNING&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;status&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">:<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;FIRING&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;message&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">:<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;...&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;labels&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">:<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>{<sp/>...<sp/>},</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;annotations&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">:{<sp/>...<sp/>},</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;fired_at&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">:<sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
